condition:
문서 GAP-366 중복 키 문구 + 키 13줄 덧붙임(PKG_DMF0049 1019-1150 · DML 1170 이전 ROLLBACK·RETURN · 원장에 같은 키 있을 때만 서버 전송) viewport:2560;cond:Report Type=Sales Plan;cond:SP Version=@pop;search;insert;copykeys:DEPARTMENT_ID,DEPT_ID,ITEM_ID,CURRENCY,COMPANY_ID,END_CUST_REPORT,CUST_REPORT,PRODUCT_GROUP,COUNTRY_CODE,BIZ_TYPE;type:@DYN=5;srvguard:Save|SELECT CASE WHEN COUNT(*) > 0 THEN 0 ELSE 1 END FROM SCM_MGR.DM_PLN_SALES_ETC_REPORT_C A WHERE A.DIVISION_ID = REGEXP_SUBSTR(@divisionId,'^[^^]*') AND A.VERSION_NO = REGEXP_SUBSTR(@versionNo,'^[^^]*') AND NVL(A.DEPARTMENT_ID,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@departmentId,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.DEPT_ID,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@deptId,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.ITEM_ID,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@itemId,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND A.MEASURE = REGEXP_SUBSTR(@measure,'^[^^]*') AND NVL(A.CURRENCY,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@currency,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.COMPANY_ID,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@companyId,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.END_CUST_REPORT,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@endCustReport,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.CUST_REPORT,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@custReport,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.PRODUCT_GROUP,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@productGroup,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND NVL(A.COUNTRY_CODE,'/') = NVL(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@countryCode,'^[^^]*'),'/') AND A.YYYYMMDD = (SELECT MIN(C.BASIS_START_DATE) FROM SCM_MGR.SCM_SYS_CALENDAR_M C WHERE SUBSTR(C.BASIS_YYYYMMDD,1,6) = SUBSTR(REGEXP_SUBSTR(@yyyymmdd,'^[^^]*'),1,6) AND C.DAYOFWEEK IN ('MON','TUE','WED','THU','FRI'))|@resp:중복되는 값이 발생했습니다\.\s*VERSION_NO_ : \S+\s+DIVISION_ID_ : 40\s+DEPARTMENT_ID_ : [^
